<!-- PRIVACY POLICY MODAL -->
<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="legal-overlay" id="privacyModal">
  <div class="legal-modal">
    <div class="legal-header">
      <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
      <button class="legal-close" onclick="closeLegal('privacy')" aria-label="Close">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 4l8 8M12 4l-8 8"/></svg>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="legal-body">
      <p><strong>Effective date:</strong> May 26, 2026 &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong>Last updated:</strong> May 26, 2026</p>

      <h3>1. Who we are</h3>
      <p>A3T ("we", "us", "our") operates the website <strong>a3t.io</strong> and the A3T platform. This privacy policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information when you visit our website or use our services.</p>

      <h3>2. Information we collect</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Account data:</strong> When you sign up, we collect your email address and display name.</li>
        <li><strong>Usage data:</strong> With your consent, we collect anonymous session recordings and page-view analytics via OpenReplay to improve the product.</li>
        <li><strong>Technical data:</strong> Browser type, operating system, IP address (anonymized), and referral source.</li>
        <li><strong>Cookies:</strong> We use strictly necessary cookies for site functionality and optional analytics cookies (see section 5).</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>3. How we use your information</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>To provide and maintain the A3T service.</li>
        <li>To improve user experience based on aggregated analytics.</li>
        <li>To communicate service updates and security notices.</li>
        <li>To comply with legal obligations.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>4. Legal basis for processing (GDPR)</h3>
      <p>We process personal data under the following bases:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Consent:</strong> For analytics cookies and session replay (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR).</li>
        <li><strong>Legitimate interest:</strong> For site security and fraud prevention (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR).</li>
        <li><strong>Contract:</strong> To deliver the service you signed up for (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR).</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>5. Cookies</h3>
      <p>We use the following categories of cookies:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Strictly necessary:</strong> Session management and consent preferences (<code>a3t_consent</code>). These cannot be disabled.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> OpenReplay session replay for product improvement. Only activated with your explicit consent.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>You can change your cookie preferences at any time via the "Cookie settings" link in the footer.</p>

      <h3>6. Data sharing</h3>
      <p>We do <strong>not</strong> sell your personal data. We may share data with:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Infrastructure providers (hosting, CDN) under data processing agreements.</li>
        <li>Law enforcement when legally required.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>7. Data retention</h3>
      <p>Account data is retained while your account is active. Analytics data is aggregated and anonymized within 90 days. You may request deletion at any time.</p>

      <h3>8. Your rights (GDPR / CCPA)</h3>
      <p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Access, rectify, or erase your personal data.</li>
        <li>Restrict or object to processing.</li>
        <li>Data portability.</li>
        <li>Withdraw consent at any time without affecting prior processing.</li>
        <li>Lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To exercise any of these rights, contact us at <strong>privacy@a3t.io</strong>.</p>

      <h3>9. International transfers</h3>
      <p>Your data may be processed in the EU and/or the United States. When transferred outside the EEA, we rely on Standard Contractual Clauses or adequacy decisions.</p>

      <h3>10. Security</h3>
      <p>We implement industry-standard security measures including encryption in transit (TLS), access controls, and regular audits.</p>

      <h3>11. Changes to this policy</h3>
      <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Material changes will be communicated via the website or email.</p>

      <h3>12. Contact</h3>
      <p>For privacy-related inquiries: <strong>privacy@a3t.io</strong></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

